# Leftovers of the old DrumSynth install the drumsynths/ collection came from:
# drumsyn.exe and ds2wav.dll are identical to bin/, drumsyn.hlp is the help file,
# DrumSyn.ini holds local window and path settings, ds2wav.exe is a third-party
# 2019 .NET tool of unknown origin. See the commit that added drumsynths/.
drumsynths/drumsyn.exe
drumsynths/ds2wav.exe
drumsynths/drumsyn.hlp
drumsynths/DrumSyn.ini
